## Checklist before shipping an instrument hero set

- [ ] Exterior: L-body, chunky cube, open well + rim, deck-parked cap, cable-channel loom
- [ ] Exterior: dark glass + bezel, square finger-sized keys, visible screws
- [ ] Interior cutaway (`00-hero`): source → cuvette → detector + PCB + cell, one composition
- [ ] Materials honest (no FR4-as-screen on closed views)
- [ ] Would a competent designer call this quiet and inevitable? If no → fix the rule, not the one render
